  "stem": "A plot of land is shaped like right triangle \\(ABC\\), with the right angle at \\(C\\). The value of \\(\\cos A\\) is \\(\\frac{20}{29}\\), and the area of the plot is 840 square meters. What is the length, in meters, of side \\(\\overline{AB}\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "58"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(\\cos A = \\frac{AC}{AB} = \\frac{20}{29}\\), so let \\(AC = 20k\\) and \\(AB = 29k\\). Then \\(BC = \\sqrt{(29k)^{2} - (20k)^{2}} = 21k\\).",
    "Area \\(= \\frac{1}{2}(20k)(21k) = 210k^{2} = 840\\), so \\(k^{2} = 4\\) and \\(k = 2\\).",
    "\\(AB = 29 \\cdot 2 = 58\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "k=symbols('k',positive=True)\nbc=sqrt((29*k)**2-(20*k)**2)\nkk=solve(Eq(20*k*bc/2,840),k)[0]\nans=29*kk\nassert ans==58\nassert all(Rational(s)==ans for s in spr_answers)\n",
